§ `s 1(1), (2), 3A`

#ASSERT `the event can trigger the Act` `an individual` `bankruptcy`
#ASSERT NOT `the event can trigger the Act` `an individual` `a winding-up order`
#ASSERT `the event can trigger the Act` `a limited liability partnership` `a winding-up order`
#ASSERT NOT `the event can trigger the Act` `a company` `a section 419 order on a deceased debtor's estate`

§ `s 1(1), (5), (6)`

#ASSERT `the insured's rights pass to the third party` `a bankrupt driver's motor policy`
#ASSERT `the insured's rights pass to the third party` `a bankrupt driver, accident after the bankruptcy`
#ASSERT `the insured's rights pass to the third party` `a contractor wound up by the court`
#ASSERT `the insured's rights pass to the third party` `an LLP clinic in receivership`
#ASSERT NOT `the insured's rights pass to the third party` `a sole trader with a receiver appointed`
#ASSERT NOT `the insured's rights pass to the third party` `a company wound up voluntarily to amalgamate`
#ASSERT `the insured's rights pass to the third party` `a company wound up voluntarily because insolvent`
#ASSERT NOT `the insured's rights pass to the third party` `an insolvent insurer's reinsurance claim`
#ASSERT NOT `the insured's rights pass to the third party` `a workplace injury under the Work Injury Compensation Act`
#ASSERT NOT `the insured's rights pass to the third party` `a solvent company's public liability policy`
#ASSERT `the insured's rights pass to the third party` `a deceased debtor's estate under a section 419 order`
#ASSERT `the insured's rights pass to the third party` `a company in a scheme with creditors`
#ASSERT `the insured's rights pass to the third party` `a company whose debenture holders took possession`
#ASSERT NOT `the insured's rights pass to the third party` `a bankrupt's house contents policy`

#ASSERT `the reconstruction exclusion applies` `a company wound up voluntarily to amalgamate`
#ASSERT NOT `the reconstruction exclusion applies` `a company wound up voluntarily because insolvent`

§ `s 1(4)`

#ASSERT `the insurer must pay the third party` 100000 60000 EQUALS 60000
#ASSERT `the insurer must pay the third party` 50000 80000 EQUALS 50000
#ASSERT `the insurer must pay the third party` 70000 70000 EQUALS 70000

#ASSERT `the third party's balance still owed by the insured` 100000 60000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the third party's balance still owed by the insured` 50000 80000 EQUALS 30000
#ASSERT `the third party's balance still owed by the insured` 70000 70000 EQUALS 0

#ASSERT `the excess the insured keeps against the insurer` 100000 60000 EQUALS 40000
#ASSERT `the excess the insured keeps against the insurer` 50000 80000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the excess the insured keeps against the insurer` 70000 70000 EQUALS 0

§ `s 1(3), 2(1)`

#ASSERT `the term is of no effect` `cover ends if the insured becomes bankrupt`
#ASSERT `the term is of no effect` `cover ends if the company is wound up`
#ASSERT `the term is of no effect` `the insurer pays the insured only, never the injured party, after insolvency`
#ASSERT `the term is of no effect` `cover ends if the insured tells a claimant about the policy`
#ASSERT `the term is of no effect` `the insured must not disclose the policy to anyone`
#ASSERT NOT `the term is of no effect` `cover excludes deliberate acts`
#ASSERT NOT `the term is of no effect` `claims must be notified within 30 days`

§ `s 2`

#ASSERT `the person must give the information` `the liquidator` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the person must give the information` `the insurer` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `the person must give the information` `the insurer` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the person must give the information` `the insured's broker` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the person must give the information` `the liquidator` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the person must give the information` `the deceased debtor's personal representative` FALSE TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT `the claimant may inspect and copy it` `a receipt for premiums` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the claimant may inspect and copy it` `a contract of insurance` FALSE

§ `s 3`

#ASSERT `section 3 disregards the dealing` `bankruptcy` `an agreement between insurer and insured` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `section 3 disregards the dealing` `bankruptcy` `an agreement between insurer and insured` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `section 3 disregards the dealing` `a winding-up order` `a payment to the insured` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `section 3 disregards the dealing` `a resolution for voluntary winding up` `a waiver by the insured` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `section 3 disregards the dealing` `appointment of a receiver or manager` `a payment to the insured` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `section 3 disregards the dealing` `a composition or arrangement with creditors` `an agreement between insurer and insured` TRUE TRUE

